+    // D2R: the real frame of the present before may still wait on the layer's
+    // present thread (LsContext::takeDeferred). It goes out before anything
+    // else touches the swapchain, and what it returned reaches the game here.
+    VkResult takeDeferredLocked(VkSwapchainKHR swapchain, bool fromAcquire) {
